  only when the feature is fully complete. Doc:
  `.aide/docs/session-aide.md`.
- `plan.aide` lifecycle flipped: ephemeral, deleted by maintainer after
  QA passes (was: retained as audit trail).
- `todo.aide` lifecycle flipped: ephemeral, deleted by maintainer after
  QA passes; retro is promoted to brain at `process/retro/` BEFORE
  deletion.
- `.aide/handoff.aide` retired and renamed to `.aide/session.aide`.

